    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1506\"><em data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1506\">(3rd Level)</em></p><p data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1563\">You annotate rituals with correspondence-perfect notes.</p><h3 data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1576\">Effects</h3><ul data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1739\"><li data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1636\"><p data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1636\">Ritual casting is faster or more stable (GM adjudicated).</p></li><li data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1685\"><p data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1685\">Aligned rituals banks additional Surge.</p></li><li data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1739\"><p data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1739\">Misaligned rituals generate a gentler misfire band than usual.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1792\">Your rituals are not safer because they are weaker.</p><p data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1834\">They are safer because they are correct.</p><p><em>Recosted 2026-08-23: this ability's earlier economy (Civic Charge / Strain / Resonance / Leverage / Administrative Pressure) is retired \u2014 everything now runs on Surge, Clarity, Noise, and the misfire ladder. The ability dialog's cost line is the truth; ledgers named here are narrative, GM-adjudicated, never a tracked pool.</em></p>",
